<p>Your cloak is lined with an automated health system that activate when no enemies are visible.</p><p>When it triggers, you will be healed for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">152, 205, 246, 281, 311</acronym> life.</p><p>At talent level 3, it will also remove one detrimental physical effect.</p><p>The system can only trigger once every <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 8, 7, 7, 6</acronym> turns.</p>